      { s: "", jp: "{背景|はいけい}には、{物|もの}があふれる{時代|じだい}に、{人|ひと}とのつながりを{求|もと}める{気持|きも}ちがあるとも{言|い}われる。", ro: "Haikei ni wa, mono ga afureru jidai ni, hito to no tsunagari o motomeru kimochi ga aru to mo iwareru.", en: "It is also said that behind this lies a desire for connection with others in an age overflowing with things." }
