      { s: "", jp: "{使|つか}いどころを{誤|あやま}ると、{皮肉|ひにく}や{嫌味|いやみ}に{響|ひび}くこともあるので{注意|ちゅうい}が{要|い}る。", ro: "Tsukai doko ro o ayamaru to, hiniku ya iyami ni hibiku koto mo aru node chūi ga iru.", en: "Misjudging the place to use them may sound like sarcasm or spite, so care is needed." }
