      { q: "What is the writer's real concern?", qjp: "ひっしゃが ほんとうに しんぱいして いる ことは？", answer: "That the purpose of efficiency is forgotten", options: ["That the purpose of efficiency is forgotten","That efficiency is evil","That numbers are hard to read","That trust is expensive"] }
