      { q: "What does the last question suggest the writer thinks?", qjp: "さいごの といから ひっしゃの かんがえは？", answer: "The link between convenience and happiness should be doubted.", options: ["Convenience guarantees happiness.","Happiness is impossible.","The link between convenience and happiness should be doubted.","Tools should be banned."] }
